      "answer": "Male and female customers are broadly distributed across the opinion space, with substantial overlap. Female customers appear somewhat more numerous and have several larger concentrations toward the positive/right side and the negative/lower-left side, while male customers are generally more evenly scattered and represented by smaller bars.",
